+===== Global repositories settings
+
+All those repository settings can also be defined globally in `elasticsearch.yml` file using prefix
+`repositories.azure.`. For example:
+
+[source,yaml]
+----
+repositories.azure:
+    container: backup-container
+    base_path: backups
+    chunk_size: 32m
+    compress": true
+----
